# Reviewed gitleaks findings in past commits, as <commit>:<path>:<rule>:<line>,
# each under a comment that says why it is not a secret. Allow current files in
# .gitleaks.toml instead. Secret scans read both files from a reviewed commit
# (the default branch, or a pull request's base), never from the change under
# scan, so a new entry takes effect only once it is merged.
